WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:06.000
. So we've already discussed today that Donald
Trump's actions on just about every issue,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.800
everything we see him do publicly, it's motivated
at least partially by.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.390
Does it hurt him in November or does it help
him in November?

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:16.039
That's the lens through which all of these
decisions are being made about carrying his

00:00:16.039 --> 00:00:20.690
mask around, about canceling the huge event
of the Republican National Convention.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:24.860
All of this stuff is just what's the calculus
in terms of how it affects my election when

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.690
it comes to vote by mail?

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:31.369
We just received some stunning new polling
data from Emerson polling.

00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:36.770
And if this data doesn't convince you that
Trump knows exactly what he's doing by opposing

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:41.079
vote by mail and confusing vote by mail with
absentee voting as if they're two different

00:00:41.079 --> 00:00:46.649
things, this data should convince you that
he knows exactly what he is doing.

00:00:46.649 --> 00:00:52.190
Polls subjects were asked in this Emmerson
polling survey who they support, Trump versus

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:57.730
Biden and grouped by whether they plan to
vote in person or vote by mail of those who

00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:00.619
plan to vote in person.

00:01:00.619 --> 00:01:06.660
Sixty five percent support Trump, and only
32 percent support Joe Biden.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:10.040
Of those who plan to vote absentee.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:16.400
76 percent support Joe Biden and only 20 percent
support Donald Trump.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.450
So put it a different way.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:22.500
Trump leads two to one among voters planning
to vote in person.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:28.500
And Biden leads almost four to one among people
planning to vote by mail.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.900
This is why Trump opposes vote by mail.

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:39.240
Now, the thing to understand is that this
split between in-person versus vote by mail

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:41.380
is not partizan per say.

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:42.840
It's health related.

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:44.650
Let me explain what I mean.

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:50.420
We know from other polling that Republicans
are roughly half as likely as Democrats to

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.870
wear masks all the time when they leave their
House.

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:56.150
I think it was something like roughly 66 to
33 year.

00:01:56.150 --> 00:02:00.240
You know, 66 percent of Democrats were wearing
a mask all the time outside their house.

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:03.580
Only 33 percent of Republicans or something
like that.

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:07.850
What this means is Democrats are taking the
pandemic more seriously.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:12.909
The reason that Biden supporters are way likely
a way more likely to vote by mail is they

00:02:12.909 --> 00:02:18.079
are taking the risk of catching coronavirus
more seriously than Republicans.

00:02:18.079 --> 00:02:22.420
Now, you could come in and say, well, if there's
more vote by mail open, more Trump supporters

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:23.760
will vote by mail.

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:28.519
If there's less vote by mail open, Biden supporters
will just go and vote in person.

00:02:28.519 --> 00:02:30.870
It's all going to shake out evenly.

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:33.880
That's exactly the wrong approach.

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.849
That is exactly the mistake that's being made.

00:02:35.849 --> 00:02:40.239
In analyzing this, Biden voters are more likely
not to vote at all.

00:02:40.239 --> 00:02:46.050
If they can't do it safely, while Trump voters
are more likely to vote in person, if that's

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:48.409
available, if that's all that's available.

00:02:48.409 --> 00:02:52.549
So sure, most Biden voters planning to vote
by mail.

00:02:52.549 --> 00:02:56.159
If they are told you can't vote by mail, they'll
put a mask on.

00:02:56.159 --> 00:02:57.870
They understand the importance.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:02.829
They'll go and take the risk because they
understand the importance of the election.

00:03:02.829 --> 00:03:08.680
But if you believe, as is probably the case,
that there are some Biden supporters who might

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:14.260
not vote at all if they can't vote absentee,
you then try to stop vote by mail altogether,

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.659
which is exactly what Donald Trump is doing.

00:03:16.659 --> 00:03:22.919
Imagine that if you take some state that could
be close and you restrict, cancel or stop

00:03:22.919 --> 00:03:28.309
vote by mail and it dissuades just three percent
of the total electorate from voting.

00:03:28.309 --> 00:03:32.590
And imagine that in that three percent who
will say, if I can't vote by mail, I'm not

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:34.129
voting at all.

00:03:34.129 --> 00:03:38.810
Imagine that 80 percent of that slice would
have voted for Biden and 20 percent of that

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:40.859
slice would have voted for Donald Trump.

00:03:40.859 --> 00:03:44.120
That can flip a state that it literally is
enough to flip a state.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.090
Let's look at Wisconsin in 2016 now.

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:50.400
Trump won Wisconsin in 2016 very narrowly.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:54.849
Trump won by about twenty two thousand votes
in 2016 and Wisconsin.

00:03:54.849 --> 00:03:58.959
If you dissuade three percent from voting,
that's a.

00:03:58.959 --> 00:04:02.889
83000 people that you would dissuade from
voting, maybe if you say you have to come

00:04:02.889 --> 00:04:04.310
in in person.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:09.949
If 80 percent of those dissuaded or Biden
supporters and 20 percent of those dissuaded

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:17.110
are Trump supporters, canceling vote by mail
grows Trump's victory by 50000 votes.

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:19.620
Now, the margin was only twenty two thousand.

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:26.730
So understand how a small portion of the electorate,
if it is mostly Biden supporters being dissuaded

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:30.650
from voting, could flip or put a state out
of reach.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:33.900
Now, this is a hypothetical example with hypothetical
numbers.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:42.090
The point is blocking vote by mail, even if
it affects a small percentage of total voters

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:47.360
based on this data, it would disproportionately
hit Biden supporters.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.770
And it could turn a state.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:54.290
So when you combine trying to prevent vote
by mail with kneecapping the post office,

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:59.020
which is what Donald Trump is doing right
now, by having selected one of his donors

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:02.800
to be postmaster general, you can actually
turn states.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:08.000
And that's why, you know, when we see, OK,
one poll has Biden winning by 15 percent,

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.990
it's not going to be 15 percent.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.090
Another poll has Biden winning by 10.

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:17.380
But when you account for the margin of error,
it might only be six if that six becomes three

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:18.380
or four.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:25.660
By Election Day, if you strategically slow
down the mail in some states and stop vote

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:32.970
by mail in other states, a three or four percent
popular vote, big victory for Joe Biden might

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:36.270
not be enough to actually win electorally
with Hillary.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:41.310
We know to point to as a or two point eight,
two point to as an Elachi as a popular vote

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:45.970
win was not enough to win electorally because
of 77000 votes in three states.

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.360
We could see that again.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:51.680
And this is why anybody who's looking at the
polling and saying, we got this, we got this,

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:53.670
got Bidens up fifteen.

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:57.930
Biden might only be up six or five when you
account for the margin of error.

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:02.810
And that could very quickly become an Electoral
College loss because of exactly this stuff.

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:04.190
Do not become complacent.

